==Russian==

===Preposition===
'''на''' (na)

'''accusative case''' ''(movement towards)'':
# [[onto]], [[on]]
#:*на [[стол#Russian|стол]] — ''onto the table''
# [[to]], [[toward]]
#:*{{RUchar|на [[почта#Russian|по́чту]]}} — ''to the post office''
# [[into]], [[in]]
#''(duration, value, purpose)'' [[for]]
#:*на [[что#Russian|что]]? — ''what for?''

'''prepositional case''' ''(position on)'':
# [[on]], [[upon]]
#:*{{RUchar|на [[стол#Russian|столе́]]}} — ''on the table''
# [[in]], [[at]]
#:*{{RUchar|на [[почта#Russian|по́чте]]}} — ''at the post office''
# [[with]], [[for]]

